<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending May 30 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE--------PV</p>
<p>FRIDAY, May 30</p>
<p>Yorkshire Water Plc     F  PFT	215.4    211.0-220.0   162.2</p>
<p>				 **DIV	 19.3     17.5-19.3     21.9</p>
<p>				 **EPS	 49.5     47.3-52.4     72.0</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a</p>
<p>consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 214.5 DIV 18.6 EPS 47.9)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>** Figures follow capital reorganisation in March</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
